    <data key="d0">Accenture Cloud Platform Inventory Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1" />
    <data key="d2">Accenture Cloud Platform evolved its inventory collection and difference engines from Lambda to Fargate to improve execution efficiency and reduce API throttling across thousands of managed accounts.</data>
